    "description": "In-app summary of PepMod terms with a link to the full document."
  },
  "privacyBody": "PepMod uses Firebase for authentication and cloud data storage, RevenueCat for subscriptions, AppRefer and Meta/Facebook App Events for attribution, and Firebase/Crashlytics for analytics and diagnostics. We do not sell your personal information. You can delete your account and saved app data from within the app.\n\nFull Privacy Policy: https://appstorecopilot.com/legal/yzh32x5v/privacy",
